      fruit: "A small capsule; seeds black.",
      root: "A single gray-brown bulb 1-2 cm wide with a papery/fibrous outer coat, sometimes with small daughter bulblets.",
      aroma: "Distinct onion/garlic odor from crushed leaves or bulb - the single most important safety trait.",
      height: "10-35 cm tall",
